WEBVTT

00:09:29.607 --> 00:09:31.400
is you can't stop a pandemic

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:34.445
just with medical science
or computer science,

00:09:34.486 --> 00:09:37.364
you need to think
about social science and behavior.

00:09:38.157 --> 00:09:39.950
And behavior could change.

00:09:40.701 --> 00:09:43.203
Because there's another thing
about those face masks,

00:09:43.245 --> 00:09:47.458
which is that effectively
they have shown how culture can change.

00:09:47.499 --> 00:09:49.418
We weren't wearing them two years ago.

00:09:50.169 --> 00:09:53.380
And culture can change
in all kinds of surprising ways.

00:09:53.422 --> 00:09:57.259
Culture isn't a box
with rigid, static sides.

00:09:57.301 --> 00:09:59.553
It's more like a river that flows.